    "text": "Let m be the smallest positive integer such that the coefficient of <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> in the expansion of <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>49</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow></msup></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>51</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> for some positive integer n.<br />Then the value of n is",
